WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.367
-Guys, it is time for "Good
Name, Bad Name, Great Name."

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:04.634
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:08.434
-♪ Good names, bad names,
great names, yes ♪

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:11.400
-First up, we have
"Gone in 60 Seconds."

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.100
Well, that's a good name
for a Nicolas Cage movie...

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.000
a bad name for your
New Year's resolution...

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.133
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.567
...a great name for CVS's supply

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:19.801
of at-home COVID tests.

00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:20.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:23.033
You got to get there quick.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.834
Next up, there's Fall Out Boy.

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:27.300
That's a good name
for a pop punk band...

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.200
a bad name for a BabyBjorn.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.334
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:31.400
And a great name

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.734
for a skydiving school.

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:35.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:37.601
After that,
we've got "Yellowstone."

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:40.400
Well, that's a good name
for a TV Western.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.067
It's a bad name
for a jewelry store.

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:43.200
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.200
And a great name for

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.367
the gravel at a dog park.

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:46.567
Oh, interesting.

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:49.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:51.601
Next up, there's
"Who Want Smoke??"

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:54.868
Well, that's a good name
for a song by Nardo Wick.

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:57.133
A bad name
for an air filtration system.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:58.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.267
It's a great name for

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.267
a vape store owned by a caveman.

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:02.601
[ Applause ]

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.133
"Who Want Smoke??"

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.400
[ Applause continues ]

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.801
Next up, there's
"Nightmare Alley."

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.667
Well, that's a good name
for a movie.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:12.067
It's a bad name for
an Airbnb listing.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:13.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.300
It's a great name for

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.400
a proctologist.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.434 --> 00:01:18.567
-[ Laughs ]
That's a great name?

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:19.667
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.267
Next up, there's
"The Music Man."

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:23.200
That's a good name
for a musical.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.400
A bad name for a mime.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.300
A great name for when your mom
is trying to remember

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.100
Post Malone's name.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.567
"The, uh...

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:33.167
The Music Man."

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.701
After that, we've got
"That's My Jam."

00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:38.634
That's a good name
for my new show on NBC.

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:41.033
That's a bad name for
a Spotify playlist

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.434
that's just four hours
of "whale sounds."

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:43.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:46.100
It's a great name for a
fistfight at a farmer's market.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.133
"Hey! That's my --"

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:50.334
[ Applause ]

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:51.968
-"It's boysenberry!"

00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:54.601
-And finally, we have
"How I Met Your Father."

00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:56.667
Well, that's a good name
for a brand-new TV show.

00:01:56.667 --> 00:01:58.634
It's a bad name
for a sperm bank.

00:01:58.634 --> 00:01:59.901
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:01.734
It's a great name for a "Maury."

00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:03.300
There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.133
That's all we have for "Good
Name, Bad Name, Great Name."

